# Every service image is built with this repository as its context, and each Dockerfile copies
# only the paths it reads. This keeps what never belongs in any of them out of the transfer.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
.git
.jj
.local
contents
data
# The gazetteer travels inside the geo image; see apps/geo/Dockerfile.
!data/source/geo
